    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stellar Dream puts you in the middle of sci-fi adventure where your choices shape your destiny and the fate of humanity. The colony ship was set out to find new worlds for human colonization and their scouts left to the three most suitable candidates, but the communication with them has been lost. Your task is to bring the scouts home, find a suitable home for the colony and establish diplomatic ties with alien life forms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore three distinct planets </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every planet available for exploration has its unique nature and humanoid aliens. Will you be able to survive in this unfamiliar environment and succeed in your mission? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meaningful relationships </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3087180/extras/1a2b411cc11f2bb728e72ea365a4e439.poster.avif?t=1755184650\" width=608 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3087180/extras/1a2b411cc11f2bb728e72ea365a4e439.webm?t=1755184650\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3087180/extras/1a2b411cc11f2bb728e72ea365a4e439.mp4?t=1755184650\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is up to you of how to approach multiple situations and what kind of character you want to be. Will you be loved? Hated? Will you make allies, find love, make your harem or corrupt others to your desires? This is all up to you!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Improve your character </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3087180/extras/473606afdb45a1f2594c03008956e108.poster.avif?t=1755184650\" width=608 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3087180/extras/473606afdb45a1f2594c03008956e108.webm?t=1755184650\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3087180/extras/473606afdb45a1f2594c03008956e108.mp4?t=1755184650\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With 5 attributes to focus and improve upon, you can create a character that is suited for your playstyle the most and use your skills in dialogues, combat or intimacy.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quests and inventory system </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3087180/extras/b828fbd99f5238f5e85c10255657e2a4.poster.avif?t=1755184650\" width=608 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3087180/extras/b828fbd99f5238f5e85c10255657e2a4.webm?t=1755184650\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3087180/extras/b828fbd99f5238f5e85c10255657e2a4.mp4?t=1755184650\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help others with their problems and earn valuable rewards. Invest your money into buying powerful weapons and defeat your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Impregnation and pregnancy </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3087180/extras/5621d3f5ebb0e8251e9ae1837aee7784.poster.avif?t=1755184650\" width=608 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3087180/extras/5621d3f5ebb0e8251e9ae1837aee7784.webm?t=1755184650\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3087180/extras/5621d3f5ebb0e8251e9ae1837aee7784.mp4?t=1755184650\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secure your future with one or more women abord the ship or even some aliens. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 100 sex scenes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Romance or corrupt over 15 characters!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore alien worlds and its habitants.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decide what kind of hero you want to be.</p></li></ul>",
